{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > A 2D type adventure RPG. [/]<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > I created a program of about 670,000 lines by myself from a blank sheet with VC ++. [/]<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Original graphics and music. [/]<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > The purpose of the adventure is to defeat the Demon King and regain peace with your friends. [/]<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Travel around the world on ships, rafts, balloons, and even big dragons for adventure. [/]<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > One of the highlights is the variety of battle scenes. [/]<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > It's a royal RPG, but there are many unusual events, so I think you can enjoy it without getting bored. [/]<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Several types of mini games are also available. [/]<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > I think you can clear it in about 12 hours. [/]<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Compatible with Windows7 and Windows10 and Windows11 [/]<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > English version is also available. [/]<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Well then, thank you. [/]</h2></h2></h2></h2></h2></h2></h2></h2></h2></h2></h2></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1502160?t=1758652177","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1502160?t=1758652177","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1502160/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758652177","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1502160/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758652177","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > A 2D type adventure RPG. [/]<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > I created a program of about 670,000 lines by myself from a blank sheet with VC ++. [/]<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Original graphics and music. [/]<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > The purpose of the adventure is to defeat the Demon King and regain peace with your friends. [/]<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Travel around the world on ships, rafts, balloons, and even big dragons for adventure. [/]<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > One of the highlights is the variety of battle scenes. [/]<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > It's a royal RPG, but there are many unusual events, so I think you can enjoy it without getting bored. [/]<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Several types of mini games are also available. [/]<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > I think you can clear it in about 12 hours. [/]<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Compatible with Windows7 and Windows10 and Windows11 [/]<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > English version is also available. [/]<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Well then, thank you. [/]</h2></h2></h2></h2></h2></h2></h2></h2></h2></h2></h2></h2>","developers":["11PLANNING"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1502160/header.jpg?t=1758652177","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1502160/381545/e7cae33b9145816cb841ee19d0f1226e0a87846c/1750996077/dash_av1.mpd?t=1625190384","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1502160/381545/e7cae33b9145816cb841ee19d0f1226e0a87846c/1750996077/dash_h264.mpd?t=1625190384","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1502160/381545/e7cae33b9145816cb841ee19d0f1226e0a87846c/1750996077/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1625190384","id":256841316,"name":"FAUN AIR -\u30d5\u30a9\u30fc\u30f3\u30a2\u30a4\u30eb-","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256841316/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1625190384"}],"name":"FAUN AIR -\u30d5\u30a9\u30fc\u30f3\u30a2\u30a4\u30eb-","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows7, Windows10, Windows11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel<br></li><li><strong>M